# BAGEL WORLD — Development Plan

## Objective

Continue development of BAGEL WORLD incrementally while preserving the existing `todo-app` project and avoiding any destructive changes to currently working code.

## Current state

- The repo currently contains a working todo application.
- There is no verified previous BAGEL WORLD implementation in the repository.
- Because of that, development proceeds by adding BAGEL WORLD V2 architecture alongside the existing app rather than replacing it.

## Strategy

1. Build a stable client/server foundation.
2. Implement the server browser and room creation workflow.
3. Add persistence and moderation scaffolding.
4. Extend to housing, smartphone, economy and social systems.
5. Add tests and deployment guidance.

