## Incremental implementation rule

Features are implemented in small, runnable units. The project remains runnable between milestones.

## Security principles

- Validate every player action on the server
- Never trust client-provided balances, permissions or move data
- Store server-generated values, not client-chosen values
- Use permission checks before allowlist actions
- Persist all data through database transactions where needed

